<rml>
<head>
    <title>Joining</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="look.rcss"/>
    <style>
        #hintbar { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 40dp; }
        #hintbar .content { padding-top: 14dp; }
        #hintbar .hints { margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<!-- Port-only (SPEC-menus.md's stage 4, a launcher's way in): a launcher's game joins on the painting alone, its dialog
     ("Joining Steel Rain..." with CANCEL, which ends the game) over it, until the room opens; 1998's ready room is
     gone. -->
<body class="painting">
    <div id="hintbar" class="bar glass">
        <div class="stage16">
            <div class="content"><div class="hints row"><div class="mouse-hints grow"></div><div class="keys"></div></div></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
